# PROTO3D: the AREAS menu, a run over ISLAND, a look at MACHINES, two glides
# in SAIL, the slate slab raised in STONE and the cliff climbed, then the bob,
# the plate and the bridge in MACHINES. Detail stays at HIGH, the level the
# game starts at (the game has no 60 setting: 30 pictures a second).
# Run (from boards/desktop): pocketme-sim --boot off --fps 30 --frames 1040 --script proto3d.script --shot <frames> --out <folder>

# --- home screen (boot off): step right 9 tiles to PROTO3D, then start it
46 press right
47 release right
48 press right
49 release right
50 press right
51 release right
52 press right
53 release right
54 press right
55 release right
56 press right
57 release right
58 press right
59 release right
60 press right
61 release right
62 press right
63 release right
64 press south   # start PROTO3D
65 release south

# The AREAS menu opens first (still at frame 85). A starts ISLAND.
90 press south  # ISLAND
91 release south

# ISLAND: hold UP to run ahead.
100 press up
130 release up

# The lines below were written by a small helper that looked at each picture
# and chose the next input (d-pad toward the next pickup, A to jump). They are plain recorded inputs now:
# the run is the same every time.
132 press right
138 press down
144 release down
147 release right
147 press left
150 press south
153 press down
159 release south
165 release down
165 release left
165 press up
168 press left
177 release left
186 press left
186 press south
195 release south
195 release up
201 press up
204 release left
204 press right
213 release right
222 press right
222 press south
225 release right
231 release south

# Stop on the small floating islet (end of the clip).
262 release up

# START opens the pause menu on HIGH, the detail in use; three DOWNs to
# AREAS, then A.
300 press plus
301 release plus
306 press down
307 release down
310 press down
311 release down
314 press down
315 release down
324 press south
325 release south

# AREAS menu: one DOWN to MACHINES, then A.
330 press down
331 release down
336 press south
337 release south

