# SAIL: run ahead, jump off the first pad, hold B (key X, east) to glide.
440 press up
466 press south
474 release south
476 press east
520 release east
# Then the second gap: steer a little right off the end of the second pad,
# jump, and glide down onto the third pad by the steps.
527 release up
527 stick left 15000 -28000
531 press south
536 stick left 8000 -31000
539 release south
541 press east
575 release east
575 stick left 0 0

